    "detailed_description": "You are alone at home. Hidden in the dark corners and dusty shelves, you discover old tapes that hold the secrets of the past. But these tapes are far from ordinary; each one is a key that pulls you into the depths of time, offering clues to understand the tragedy that befell you and your family.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the game &quot;Tempter,&quot; you travel through time, uncovering lost memories and dark secrets. Each tape gradually reveals what happened to you and your family, guiding you to complete the unfinished task they left behind. Through their experiences and the traces they left, you learn how to take revenge on the demon.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis story, filled with fear and suspense, helps you better understand what happened to your family with each tape you find, and strengthens you in your fight against the demon. Solving mysteries, completing puzzles, and making the right choices are in your hands. As you track the demon, danger awaits you every step of the way.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGather your courage, uncover dark secrets, and take your revenge on the demon.",
